I would create these top-level asset classes.

```text
VisualAsset
├── IdentityAsset
├── BodyAsset
├── DaimonAsset
├── WorldAsset
├── EffectAsset
├── StateAsset
├── CompositionAsset
└── EditorialAsset
```

## IdentityAsset

Persistent identity:

```text
AGENT_PORTRAIT
AGENT_ICON
SIGIL
FACTION_MARK
NAMEPLATE_STYLE
COLOR_SYSTEM
SYMBOL_SYSTEM
```

Example:

```text
boris/
├ portrait-neutral-R3
├ portrait-competitive-R2
├ sigil-R1
├ icon-R1
└ palette-R2
```

