# 3. Body assets

Talisman assets need far more structure than a single hero image.

```text
TALISMAN
├── HERO
├── TOP_ORTHO
├── SIDE_ORTHO
├── FRONT_ORTHO
├── REAR_ORTHO
├── 3Q_FRONT
├── 3Q_REAR
├── DETAIL
├── MATERIAL_REFERENCE
├── DAMAGE_STATE
└── EFFECT_ANCHOR_MAP
```

Minimum canonical pack:

```text
top
side
3/4
hero
material close-up
transparent/background-isolated image
```

Better later:

```text
8-view turnaround
```

This gives future image/video generation much stronger identity conditioning.

