# 4. Daimon assets

Daimons should have an explicit **visual lifecycle** tied to their actual mechanical/emergent lifecycle.

```text
LATENT
↓
PROTO
↓
EMERGING
↓
MANIFEST
↓
DEVELOPED
↓
ASCENDED
```

Each stage can have its own asset pack.

Example:

```text
PENELOPE
├ latent-symbol-R1
├ emerging-apparition-R1
├ manifest-body-R3
├ developed-body-R4
└ ascended-body-R1
```

And every manifested Daimon should have:

```text
neutral view
full-body
portrait
manifestation pose
combat pose
silhouette
glyph
aura/effect reference
```

The Daimon does **not** regenerate randomly after every evolution event.

Instead:

```text
DaimonState changes
↓
VisualEvolutionRequest created
↓
new visual candidates
↓
new canonical version
```

