# 6. Effect assets

This is one of the most important reusable libraries.

Create:

```text
EffectGrammar
```

rather than one-off effects.

Example:

```text
effects/
├ impact/
├ fire/
├ water/
├ air/
├ earth/
├ aether/
├ phase/
├ shield/
├ burst/
├ daimon-manifest/
└ reincarnation/
```

Each effect grammar should contain:

```text
shape language
color rules
particle behavior
light behavior
motion behavior
surface interaction
sound identity
allowed variation
forbidden variation
```

Example:

```text
MOMENTUM_REDIRECT_VISUAL_R2

visual:
curved compression wave
brief silver-blue arc
no explosion
direction follows transferred momentum

timing:
starts 60ms before contact
peak at contact
dissipates within 300ms
```

Now every occurrence looks like the same ability.

