# 7. State assets

This is the piece that makes autonomous video generation much easier.

Persistent objects can have **temporary state assets**.

For example:

```text
BORIS_TALISMAN_R17
+
MATCH_STATE_184
↓
StateAsset
```

State describes:

```text
orientation
damage
energy level
active ability
Daimon manifestation
lighting context
temporary markings
```

So you can generate:

```text
boris-r17-energy-low
boris-r17-phase-active
boris-r17-damaged
```

without changing the underlying canonical body identity.

Think:

```text
BASE ASSET
+
STATE DELTA
=
SHOT REFERENCE
```

Very powerful.

