# 9. VisualSpec

Before generating any image, create a **machine-readable VisualSpec**.

Never make the prompt the source of truth.

Example:

```yaml
entity_id: boris:talisman
mechanical_version: R17

class: talisman

identity:
  silhouette: compact-wide
  visual_weight: center-heavy
  symmetry: radial
  personality: controlled-aggressive

materials:
  primary: dark brushed metal
  secondary: polished silver
  accent: translucent mineral

palette:
  base: near-black
  secondary: silver
  accent: pale-blue

motifs:
  - concentric cuts
  - restrained wave geometry
  - central sigil

forbidden:
  - exposed gears
  - fire motifs
  - organic flesh
  - text
  - asymmetric blade count

required_views:
  - top
  - side
  - three_quarter
  - hero
```

Then:

```text
VisualSpec
↓
PromptCompiler
↓
provider-specific prompt
```

This is what makes the system autonomous and replaceable.

